#: runtests.cpp:364
msgid ""
"You磖e not allowed to dial out with kppp.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"你不被允许使用 kppp 拨号出去.\n"
"和你的系统管理员联系."

#: runtests.cpp:381
msgid ""
"This kernel has no PPP support, neither\n"
"compiled in nor via the kernel module\n"
"loader.\n"
"\n"
"To solve this problem:\n"
"  * contact your system adminstrator\n"
"or\n"
"  * install a kernel with PPP support\n"
msgstr ""
"此内核不支持 PPP——既未编译进去，也没有通过\n"
"内核模块加载器提供。\n"
"\n"
"解决办法:\n"
"  * 联系系统管理员\n"
"或\n"
"  * 安装带 PPP 支持的内核\n"

#: runtests.cpp:412
msgid ""
"You do not have the permission\n"
"to start pppd!\n"
"\n"
"Contact your system administrator\n"
"and ask to get access to pppd."
msgstr ""
"你没有权限启动 pppd!\n"
"\n"
"请和你的系统管理员联系 , 并得到\n"
"使用 pppd 的权限."

#: runtests.cpp:423 runtests.cpp:437
msgid ""
"pppd is not properly installed!\n"
"\n"
"The pppd binary must be installed\n"
"with the SUID bit set. Contact your\n"
"system administrator."
msgstr ""
"pppd 没有正确安装!\n"
"\n"
"pppd 可执行文件必须安装成 SUID\n"
"程序. 请和你的系统管理员联系."

#: runtests.cpp:472
msgid ""
"kppp has detected a 'lock' option in /etc/ppp/options.\n"
"\n"
"This option has to be removed since kppp takes care of device locking itself.\n"
"Contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"kppp 检测到在 /etc/ppp/options 中有一个 `lock' 选项.\n"
"\n"
"因为 kppp 自己会处理设备锁定 , 这个选项需要被去掉.\n"
"请和你的系统管理员联系."

#: runtests.cpp:497
msgid ""
"is missing!\n"
"\n"
"Ask your system administrator to create\n"
"a non-empty file that has appropriate\n"
"read and write permissions."
msgstr ""
"缺失！\n"
"\n"
"请系统管理员创建一个具有适当读写权限的\n"
"非空文件。"

