#: ppplog.cpp:136
msgid ""
"You have launched pppd before the remote server was ready to establish a PPP connection.\n"
"Please use the terminal-based login to verify"
msgstr ""
"您在远程服务器就绪前就启动了 pppd。\n"
"请改用基于终端的登录方式核实"

#: ppplog.cpp:141
msgid "You haven't started the PPP software on the peer system."
msgstr "您尚未在对端系统上启动 PPP 软件。"

#: ppplog.cpp:144
msgid "Check that you supplied the correct username and password!"
msgstr "请检查您提供的用户名和密码是否正确！"

#: ppplog.cpp:147
msgid "You shouldn't pass 'lock' as an argument to pppd. Check /etc/ppp/options and ~/.ppprc"
msgstr "不应向 pppd 传递 lock 参数。请检查 /etc/ppp/options 与 ~/.ppprc"

#: ppplog.cpp:151
msgid ""
"The remote system does not seem to answer to\n"
"configuration request! Contact your provider!"
msgstr "远程系统似乎不响应配置请求！请联系您的提供商！"

#: ppplog.cpp:155
msgid "You have passed an invalid option to pppd. See `man pppd' for a complete list of valid arguments."
msgstr "向 pppd 传递了无效选项。完整有效参数列表见 `man pppd'。"

#: ppplog.cpp:170
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notice that the remote system has sent the following message:\n"
"\"%s\"\n"
"This may give you a hint why the the connection has failed."
msgstr ""
"注意远程系统发来如下消息:\n"
"\"%s\"\n"
"或许能提示您连接失败的原因。"

#: ppplog.cpp:189
msgid "Sorry. Can't help you here."
msgstr "抱歉，这里帮不了您。"

#: ppplog.cpp:206
msgid ""
"KPPP could not prepare a PPP log. It磗 very likely\n"
"that pppd was started without the \"debug\" option.\n"
"\n"
"Without this option it磗 difficult to find out PPP\n"
"problems, so you should turn on the debug option.\n"
"\n"
"Shall I turn it on now?"
msgstr ""
"KPPP 无法生成 PPP 日志。很可能 pppd 启动时没有带\n"
"\"debug\" 选项。\n"
"\n"
"没有该选项很难排查 PPP 问题，建议打开调试选项。\n"
"\n"
"要现在打开吗？"

#: ppplog.cpp:217
msgid ""
"The \"debug\" option has been added. You\n"
"should now try to reconnect. If that fails\n"
"again, you will get a PPP log that may help\n"
"you to track down the connection problem."
msgstr ""
"已添加 \"debug\" 选项。现在请尝试重新连接。若再次\n"
"失败，您将得到 PPP 日志，有助于定位连接问题。"

#: ppplog.cpp:232
msgid "PPP log"
msgstr "PPP 日志"

#: ppplog.cpp:236
msgid "kppp's diagnosis (just guessing):"
msgstr "kppp 的诊断（仅作猜测）："

#: ppplog.cpp:241
msgid "Write to file"
msgstr "写入文件"

